 the most gentle, balanced and socially competent in personality; but his unusual hair color, inherited from his late English mother, leads classmates to assume he is a violent and abusive delinquent and spread defamatory rumors about him. Because of his long experience of antagonism, Kodaka has become accustomed to fighting and can defend himself quite well. The reason why Kodaka has a hard time making friends is mostly due to his looks."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6428"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f0816e626256f47c1ae7b3b5ef18685f6e559170cb31b5d1af3cf376b351c16c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ffa55fbd07d135626e4bc7ad65bd2ba417103d6bf3530bf9f3ab20ff2815be9d.webp","width":160,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"木村 良平","creatorId":"vndb:s382","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s382","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s382","name":"木村 良平","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:43403","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6430","characterName":"三日月夜空","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6430"},"originalCharacterName":"三日月夜空","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1224"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A cruel and selfish black-haired girl who says she understands and respects bullying but resents being called a bully herself, Yozora's difficult personality drives away anyone who might wish to make friends with her before she meets Kodaka. She is physically abusive towards, and often argues with, Sena and manipulative towards Maria, who she cons into giving up an empty room for the use of the Neighbor's Club, and Yukimura, who she fools into working for the club as a crossdressing cosplay maid. The reason why Yozora doesn't have any friends is because she's a natural loner and dislikes \"normals\", preferring to have an \"air friend\", whom she calls \"Tomo-chan\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6430"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a7a717d6a287837c43be6238bb06e94bfd60961c60e7ba86ac2f98a17bd224dc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/70407422a342fc7b53a1b06b5f2aa2da8262b9f2bdedb7346a0c67edeab3b887.webp","width":155,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"井上 麻里奈","creatorId":"vndb:s1774","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1774","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1774","name":"井上 麻里奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:43406","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6431","characterName":"柏崎 星奈","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6431"},"originalCharacterName":"柏崎 星奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"519"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"164"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The wealthy blonde daughter of the school's headteacher, Sena shows a dislike of all things \"ordinary.\" She is both attractive and academically successful, but her resulting arrogance leads her to be disliked by her female peers. Their admiration eludes her, much as she desires it; she treats her male classmates only as servants to be used, although many of them would like to be her boyfriend. Nonetheless, she holds Kodaka to a higher standard. She enjoys playing video games, including dating sims and eroge, partially because they allow her to make female (if virtual) friends. Sena doesn't have any female friends because she is envied by other girls due to her good looks and popularity with the opposite sex."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6431"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a3/a33d66c72d305d1198917036bf7024f2011ebf865468366e5f194f477b988215.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0d76a671b7aa2e094ff5db968f4239dcecc401626ea07f67502dfa1804a624da.webp","width":154,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"伊藤 かな恵","creatorId":"vndb:s853","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s853","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s853","name":"伊藤かな恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:43404","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6432","characterName":"羽瀬川 小鳩","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6432"},"originalCharacterName":"羽瀬川 小鳩","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1018"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"150"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"44"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kodaka's younger sister; she is a student in middle school, but nonetheless joins the club. She is very close to her brother, who she calls \"An-Chan\", and behaves in a jealous and clingy way whenever she feels that he is not giving her the attention she deserves, to the point where it is obvious that she has a brother complex. She sees Maria as a rival for Kodaka's brotherly affections and so often gets into fights with the latter. She has had a penchant for darkness, vampires and the macabre ever since she started watching an anime called Kurogane no Necromancer. The reason why Kobato cannot make friends, (or rather, doesn't want to make any friends) is because she is under a constant self-delusion of being a Gothic vampire, and being naturally shy. In fact, she is wildly popular with the other students of her class, boys and girls alike."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia.org"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6432"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6a/6a9e0d416be6638dbb07cd03fa8b3c2cbb5ff352cd7338dc666f83a141c45ad9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5a/5a5a79b7f4136b33c7a2ab8600906fadb45925b069baf51153554c04275605bb.webp","width":160,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"花澤 香菜","creatorId":"vndb:s237","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s237","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s237","name":"花澤香菜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:43401","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6433","characterName":"志熊 理科","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6433"},"originalCharacterName":"志熊 理科","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"228"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"154"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A freshman and highly capable mad scientist. She has a habit of inserting any sexual innuendo possible in her sentences, to the point where she finds it normal to convert any innocent thought into something perverted."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As a fujoshi, she is a passionate consumer of BL doujinshi and magazines, is comically aroused by intercourse between mecha. Rika is proud of her pervertedness, as she says that she would be a boring person if people only thought of her as a genius girl."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"To compound her eccentricity, she speaks in the third person. Rika was a shut-in before joining, being isolated from the outside world her personal room in the school, she prefers the life of a loner like Yozora and like her, is extremely anti-social."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6433"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f4/f4acc8025babbd43f3aafdc68a6d157854e6db257217ac5bdac22a76fb3faeb6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/61/61f31584528ff08919ac29e852c5823ad5221119aca5cf669c409596c2bd25ae.webp","width":142,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"福圓 美里","creatorId":"vndb:s362","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s362","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s362","name":"福圓 美里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:43402","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c6434","characterName":"楠 幸村","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c6434"},"originalCharacterName":"楠 幸村","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"613"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"153"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A gullible student with low self-esteem, she admiringly believes Kodaka to be a romantic and masculine outlaw who lives life the way he wants to, and eagerly pledges to become his \"underling\" on the basis that she can learn to become less effeminate through him; however, she also appears to harbor a crush on him. She fittingly refers to Kodaka as \"Aniki\" and she tends to obey his \"orders\" to the extreme. The reason why Yukimura is unable to get friends is because she thinks she is a boy (despite her assignment at birth), which makes the boys uncomfortable, as well as her slightly over-the-top fascination for manliness."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia.org"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6434"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cb/cb61f790c334e1facd29c2d7a070ef43f5d36829c8007a2eb4b2532fa5ff03b6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7d5a04fc5d7535ea939cdbd1f7da7a956c34163cbad041fabca5a78a550012ba.webp","width":139,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":